   :positive
   "Exercise valid pointer, region, buffer, cleanup and MMIO/atomic mappings with retained proof/check/audit metadata; reject missing/stale provenance, range, lifetime and access-order evidence.",
   :original-obligation
   "Lower C pointer/memory/MMIO operations only with applicable provenance, range, lifetime, alignment, alias and ordering evidence or explicit unsafe audit.",
